  "question": "The restaurant receives multiple orders, each of which has an order number, customer information, order time, and total amount. The order contains multiple dishes, each of which has a name and price. The restaurant needs to record the detailed information of each dish and the status of the order (such as received, prepared, and delivered).",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0019\nCREATE TABLE `orders` (\n  `order_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `order_number` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `customer_info` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `order_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `total_amount` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  `order_status` varchar(20) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`order_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `order_number` (`order_number`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `dishes` (\n  `dish_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `dish_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `dish_price` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  `dish_details` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`dish_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `order_dishes` (\n  `order_dish_id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `order_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `dish_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `quantity` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `line_total` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`order_dish_id`),\n  KEY `order_id` (`order_id`),\n  KEY `dish_id` (`dish_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `order_dishes_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`order_id`) REFERENCES `orders` (`order_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `order_dishes_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`dish_id`) REFERENCES `dishes` (`dish_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
